# Rules kernel CR bugs

When a Comprehensive Rules mismatch is found in `rules-engine/`:

1. Fix the reducer so the CR order is what actually happens.
2. Add a test that would fail on the old behavior (prefer a named fixture that makes the zone/order difference observable, e.g. Timetwister vs its own graveyard).
3. Commit that fix and test without waiting to be asked.
